omment-304501781","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/2887","id":304501781,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMwNDUwMTc4MQ==","user":{"login":"or-shachar","id":2962963,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NjI5NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2962963?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar","html_url":"https://github.com/or-shachar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/or-shachar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-28T09:00:30Z","updated_at":"2017-05-28T09:00:30Z","body":"@ulfjack - I'm trying to explore running (java) tests with **remote-executor** (the new name for **remote-worker**), and I get errors as well. Will be happy if you can share more details about your issues so we can see if it's in the same area. \r\n\r\n# Steps I took to run with remote-executor\r\n## env details\r\n* mac osx sierra\r\n* bazel latest:\r\n```\r\nsh-3.2$ bazel info\r\nbazel-bin: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297/execroot/io_bazel/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/bin\r\nbazel-genfiles: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297/execroot/io_bazel/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/genfiles\r\nbazel-testlogs: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297/execroot/io_bazel/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/testlogs\r\ncharacter-encoding: file.encoding = ISO-8859-1, defaultCharset = ISO-8859-1\r\ncommand_log: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297/command.log\r\ncommitted-heap-size: 441MB\r\nexecution_root: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297/execroot/bazel\r\ngc-count: 13\r\ngc-time: 528ms\r\ninstall_base: /var/tmp/_bazel_ors/install/f4a9e365ac61eed3e8e0d648b9ec0ece\r\njava-home: /Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/jdk1.8.0_111.jdk/Contents/Home/jre\r\njava-runtime: Java(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.8.0_111-b14) by Oracle Corporation\r\njava-vm: Java HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 25.111-b14, mixed mode) by Oracle Corporation\r\nmax-heap-size: 3817MB\r\nmessage_log: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297/message.log\r\noutput_base: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297\r\noutput_path: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/28db95c6b9836014965a7adc3e713297/execroot/bazel/bazel-out\r\npackage_path: %workspace%\r\nrelease: development version\r\nserver_pid: 82416\r\nused-heap-size: 111MB\r\nworkspace: /Users/ors/workspace/third-party/bazel-wrapper/bazel\r\n```\r\n## start remote-executor service\r\n(used [this readme](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/tree/master/src/tools/remote_worker))\r\n1. Updated to latest bazel runner (HEAD - as they renamed remote-worker to remote-executor in their latest code).\r\n2. Compiled the bazel-executor : `bazel build src/tools/remote-worker:all`\r\n3. Ran the worker like this:\r\n```bash\r\n$ bazel-bin/src/tools/remote_worker/remote_worker \\\r\n      --work_path=/tmp/test \\\r\n      --listen_port=3030\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Run java tests using the remote executor\r\nI wrote two very basic junit test classes and tried to run it like this:\r\n(this time used hints from [this guide](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/tree/master/src/tools/remote_worker) and [this guide](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/tree/master/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/remote))\r\n```\r\n$ bazel --host_jvm_args=-Dbazel.DigestFunction=SHA1 test \\\r\n      --spawn_strategy=remote \\\r\n      --remote_executor=localhost:3030 \\\r\n      --remote_cache=localhost:3030 \\\r\n      --test_output=errors \\\r\n      --strategy=Javac=remote \\\r\n      --remote_local_fallback=false \\\r\n      --remote_timeout=600 \\\r\n      //src/main/java/com/jetty/...\r\n```\r\n(note that the flag `--remote_executor` will not work in bazel < 0.5, before that it was called `--remote_worker`)\r\n\r\n## result\r\n```\r\n..........\r\n____Downloading https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_scala/archive/a72dc8bb2033fed96deec39420b99331a2119a4e.zip via codeload.github.com: 40,240 bytes\r\n____Downloading https://github.com/bazelbuild/rules_scala/archive/a72dc8bb2033fed96deec39420b99331a2119a4e.zip via codeload.github.com: 108,516 bytes\r\n____Loading package: src/main/java/com/jetty\r\n____Loading package: @bazel_tools//tools/cpp\r\n____Loading package: @local_jdk//\r\n____Loading package: @local_config_cc//\r\n____Loading package: @local_config_xcode//\r\n____Loading complete.  Analyzing...\r\n____Loading package: tools/defaults\r\n____Loading package: @bazel_tools//tools/test\r\n____Loading package: @jetty_continuation//jar\r\n____Loading package: @jetty_io//jar\r\n____Loading package: @jetty_util//jar\r\n____Loading package: @jetty_http//jar\r\n____Loading package: @jetty_server//jar\r\n____Loading package: @bazel_tools//tools/coverage\r\n____Found 2 targets and 2 test targets...\r\n____Building...\r\n____[0 / 2] Expanding template src/main/java/com/jetty/jtest_port2\r\n____[4 / 9] Writing file src/main/java/com/jetty/libjetty-hjar.jar-2.params\r\n____[6 / 14] Extracting interface @jetty_util//jar:jar\r\n____[11 / 16] Extracting interface @jetty_io//jar:jar\r\n____[13 / 19] Expanding template src/main/java/com/jetty/jtest_port\r\n____[26 / 28] Testing //src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port2\r\n____[26 / 28] Still waiting for 2 jobs to complete:\r\n      Running (remote):\r\n        Testing //src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port, 10 s\r\n        Testing //src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port2, 10 s\r\nFAIL: //src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port (see /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/6fef11fd814f511560e9927cee7468ad/execroot/__main__/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/testlogs/src/main/java/com/jetty/jtest_port/test.log)\r\nERROR: Caught I/O exception: java.io.FileNotFoundException: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/6fef11fd814f511560e9927cee7468ad/execroot/__main__/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/testlogs/src/main/java/com/jetty/jtest_port/test.log (No such file or directory).\r\nERROR: /Users/ors/workspace/workshops/bazel-scala-test/src/main/java/com/jetty/BUILD:24:1:  failed: unexpected I/O exception: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/6fef11fd814f511560e9927cee7468ad/execroot/__main__/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/testlogs/src/main/java/com/jetty/jtest_port/test.log (No such file or directory).\r\n==================== Test output for //src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port:\r\nWARNING: TestRunner remote work failed (io.grpc.StatusRuntimeException: CANCELLED).\r\nFAIL: //src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port2 (see /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/6fef11fd814f511560e9927cee7468ad/execroot/__main__/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/testlogs/src/main/java/com/jetty/jtest_port2/test.log)\r\nERROR: Caught I/O exception: java.io.FileNotFoundException: /private/var/tmp/_bazel_ors/6fef11fd814f511560e9927cee7468ad/execroot/__main__/bazel-out/darwin_x86_64-fastbuild/testlogs/src/main/java/com/jetty/jtest_port2/test.log (No such file or directory).\r\n____Elapsed time: 23.816s, Critical Path: 13.27s\r\n//src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port                                     FAILED in 12.9s\r\n//src/main/java/com/jetty:jtest_port2                                    FAILED in 13.0s\r\n\r\nExecuted 2 out of 2 tests: 2 fail locally.\r\n```\r\n\r\n@philwo  - will be happy if you can have a look as well.\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reaction