low_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["bazel","build","build-system","correct","fast","multi-language","scalable","test"],"visibility":"public","forks":4359,"open_issues":1819,"watchers":24886,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Description of the problem / feature request / question:\r\nI am running java_test (junit) using locally started remote executor and I get that the test has passed way too soon. I noticed that even with a simplest junit test that just throws exception I get that the test has passed.\r\n\r\n### STRP\r\n1. with latest bazel\r\n2. clone this repo: https://github.com/or-shachar/bazel-sample-repo\r\n3. run the test locally to notice that it fails:\r\n```\r\n$ bazel test //src/main/java/com/example/...\r\n```\r\n4. start remote worker\r\n```sh\r\n$ cd ${bazel_git_repo}\r\n$ bazel build //src/tools/remote_worker\r\n$ bazel-bin/src/tools/remote_worker/remote_worker \\\r\n      --work_path=/tmp/test \\\r\n      --listen_port=3030\r\n```\r\n5. change one character in `/src/main/java/com/example/MyTest.java` to avoid using cache.\r\n6. Run the test with the remote worker:\r\n```sh\r\n$ cd ${bazel-sample-repo}\r\n$ bazel --host_jvm_args=-Dbazel.DigestFunction=SHA1 test \\\r\n      --spawn_strategy=remote \\\r\n      --remote_executor=localhost:3030 \\\r\n      --remote_cache=localhost:3030 \\\r\n      --strategy=Javac=remote \\\r\n      --remote_local_fallback=false \\\r\n      --remote_timeout=600 \\\r\n      //src/main/java/com/example/...\r\n```\r\n7. notice how the test suddenly PASS.\r\n\r\n### Environment info\r\n* Operating System: **mac os x sierra**\r\n* Bazel version: **development version** (`956810b6ee24289e457a4b8d0a84ff56eb32c264`)\r\n\r\n###  Have you found anything relevant by searching the web?\r\nThere seems to be some changes in the remote executor area. issue #2887 and fixed in here -\r\n https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/commit/8c67e3e50f58780ed261289b1418e734a20bbb5a  by @ulfjack \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/3121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/3121/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]